#C(168,005)|Turn 2|
#F015
#L(016,050)|You've made it to the second turn!|
#F007
#L(016,075)|If you are wondering what to do next,|
#L(016,095)|make sure you've tried attacking a city|
#L(016,115)|and searching a ruin.|
#F015
#L(016,140)|Also, if you haven't done so already, try|
#L(016,160)|"right-clicking" on some things on the|
#L(016,180)|screen.  This is a standard way to gain|
#L(016,200)|more information in Warlords.|
#F007
#L(016,225)|You can right-click in many areas - try it|
#L(016,245)|over cities and ruins, over army groups|
#L(016,265)|or signposts - even over buttons.|
#L(016,285)|Almost all areas in the game will yield|
#L(016,305)|some more information this way!|
